#. +> trunk stable
#: htmlopts.cpp:162
msgid ""
"<html>Controls how Konqueror shows animated images:<br />"
"<ul>"
"<li><b>Enabled</b>: Show all animations completely.</li>"
"<li><b>Disabled</b>: Never show animations, show the starting image only.</li>"
